              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jihadharini msijiingize mtegoni kwa kuyafuata baada ya kuangamizwa mbele yenu. Msijisumbue kujua kuhusu miungu yao, mkisema, ‘Mataifa haya yaliabuduje miungu yake? – ili nasi tuwaabudu vivyo hivyo’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.12.30",
